Device interface layout:
0: ff/ff/ff - serial
1: ff/00/00 - serial AT+PPP
2: ff/ff/ff - QMI/wwan
3: 08/06/50 - storage

Signed-off-by: Bjørn Mork <bjorn@mork.no>
